<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 425)</h2>
<p><b>Notes follow the side you're working on.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>While comparing, a new note lands on the side you're looking at — flip to the B version and your note belongs to it, frame numbers translated through the compare offset. The amber strip above the composer always names the exact target.</li>
<li>Film Lab's stock lists are grouped by family: motion color and B&amp;W, stills, reversal, instant, aerial — and on the print side, motion print stocks and color/B&amp;W/reversal papers.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
